# mother

!! notes for future scenes I will write that will need to be added to this or made into a new file later.
!! Monday evenings for a couple of hours at Luda''s, I will be adding that scene to Luda''s file
!! Wed Evenings for a couple of hours gone from the apartment to do laundry, no scene but just so there is some time when she is not home
!! Friday gone for a couple of hours to the supermarket. I will write a scene where Sveta can run into her there, but also so she won''t be home
!! Saturday gone a couple of hours in the day to do laundry again, no scene just a time she won''t be home.
!! Sunday after noon, gone to church for a couple of hours. I will write a scene where Sveta can run into her at the church.
!! plus need to set the times where she goes to visit Sergey
if $ARGS[0] = '':
	!!Model Olga Kabaeva
	motherAge = year - ((npc_dob['A29'] - (npc_dob['A29'] mod 10000)) / 10000)

	if momslut >= 2 and npc_rel['A29'] < 40: npc_rel['A29'] = 40
