			'Your <<$npc_nickname[''A29'']>> looks at you from across the cafe counter. "<<$pcs_firstname>> <<$pcs_lastname>>, where the hell have you been?! I have been worried sick!" She then looks around the cafe. "We''ll talk about this when we get home!"'
		elseif hour > 8:
			'Your <<$npc_nickname[''A29'']>> looks tired and angry. "Where the hell were you last night, young lady?! I waited up all night thinking you''d been abducted or worse! You''re still a child and that means you sleep here at home! I don''t need another slut for a daughter!"'
		else
			'Your <<$npc_nickname[''A29'']>> is still awake, waiting for you to come home. Hearing the front door, she comes to the hallway and scolds you.'
			'"Where the hell have you been, <<$pcs_nickname>>? You shouldn''t be out this late!"'
		end
	elseif motherWorry = 1 and locat['Fam_inGad'] > 0:
		motherWorry = 0
	end

	!!while at work at the train station cafe
	if $loc = 'gkafe':
		cla
		'Your <<$npc_nickname[''A29'']>> sees you and frowns. "<<$pcs_nickname>>, how many times have I told you not to visit me at work? I have no time for you right now, and there''s nothing for young girls like you to do here."'
		act 'Move away from her': gt 'gkafe'
		exit
	end

	!!check hair color
