								'Your <<$npc_nickname[''A29'']>> reluctantly gives you <<moneyfrommom70>> <b>₽</b>. "When you do better in school, I''ll give you more. In the meantime, this is all you deserve!"'
								act 'Thank her': gt 'mother'
							else
