		'You keep quiet, hoping that your <<$npc_nickname[''A29'']>> will let it pass, but she''s adamant and asks you once again.'
		'"Did Anya give it to you?!" she angrily asks.'
		'"N-No!" you stutter. "It was a gift from a friend. She misclicked when ordering and bought two, so she gave the extra one to me..."'
		'"A gift, huh?" Your <<$npc_nickname[''A29'']>> is hesitant to believe you.'
		!! If Sveta has several dildos
		if mc_inventory['dildo_small'] + mc_inventory['dildo_normal'] + mc_inventory['dildo_big'] + mc_inventory['dildo_large'] + mc_inventory['dildo_huge'] + mc_inventory['dildo_enormous'] + mc_inventory['dildo_gigantic'] > 1:
			'"Your friend must be quite rich if she gave all these away..."'
			'"They have quite a lot of money, yes..." you try to explain.'
			'"Oh honey, you need to find the correct one and use that, not have lots of them laying around. What if we have guests over and the stumble across one? I would be so ashamed..."'
			'"Don''t let them enter my room then! This is getting too awkward and I don''t want to talk about it anymore..." you reply.'
			'"Fine, fine... I still don''t understand why you need so many of them..." she comments as she leaves the room.'
		elseif mc_inventory['dildo_small'] = 1 or mc_inventory['dildo_normal'] = 1:
			'"I''ll give your friend this at least. She picked the perfect starting dildo. The size should fit someone unexperienced..."'
			'You quickly yank the dildo out of her hand. "I don''t want to talk with you about this! This is so awkward!" you yell as you start blushing.'
			'"Okay, okay. Just so you know I''m not too fond of you owning a dildo, but it''s better than having you running around having sex with boys."'
			'"<<$npc_nickname[''A29'']>>! Leave! Now!" you shout.'
		elseif mc_inventory['dildo_big'] = 1 or mc_inventory['dildo_large'] = 1:
			'"Isn''t this a bit too big for you and your friend? It''s... a bit bigger than I expected to find if I were ever to find something like this..."'
			'You quickly yank the dildo out of her hand. "I don''t want to talk with you about this! This is so awkward!" you yell as you start blushing.'
			'"Okay, okay. Just so you know I''m not too fond of you owning a dildo, but it''s better than having you running around having sex with boys."'
			'"<<$npc_nickname[''A29'']>>! Leave! Now!" you shout.'
		elseif mc_inventory['dildo_huge'] = 1 or mc_inventory['dildo_enormous'] = 1:
			'<<$npc_nickname[''A29'']>> starts laughing, "Well, I understand why your friend gave it away! There is now way this will fit-"'
			'You quickly yank the dildo out of her hand. "I don''t want to talk with you about this! This is so awkward!" you yell as you start blushing.'
			'"Okay, okay. Just so you know I''m not too fond of you owning a dildo, but it''s better than having you running around having sex with boys."'
			'"<<$npc_nickname[''A29'']>>! Leave! Now!" you shout.'
		else
			'"What was your friend thinking, <<$pcs_nickname>>?! This would ruin anyone''s lady parts forever! I forbid you from even trying to use this! Which friend gave you this? I need to call and tell her mother too..."'
			'You quickly yank the dildo out of her hand. "I don''t want to talk with you about this! This is so awkward!" you yell as you start blushing.'
			'"Okay, okay. Just so you know I''m not too fond of you owning a dildo, but it''s better than having you running around having sex with boys."'
			'"<<$npc_nickname[''A29'']>>! Leave! Now!" you shout.'
		end
		act 'Put away the dildo'+iif(mc_inventory['dildo_small'] + mc_inventory['dildo_normal'] + mc_inventory['dildo_big'] + mc_inventory['dildo_large'] + mc_inventory['dildo_huge'] + mc_inventory['dildo_enormous'] + mc_inventory['dildo_gigantic'] > 1, 's',''): gt 'bedrPar'
